(4788004, 691551, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Like the selective desaturation. Actually the otherway would have been better, like the dreamer in B&amp;W and the rest in color, which would give a feel that the scene she is dreaming about is more colorful than her. My humble thoughts...!</td>', 'Great concept. Like the selective desaturation. Actually the otherway would have been better, like the dreamer in B&W and the rest in color, which would give a feel that the scene she is dreaming about is more colorful than her. My humble thoughts...!', '2008-06-27 12:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788006, 691161, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. A very different one from the stereotype hope and faith pictures in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition. A very different one from the stereotype hope and faith pictures in this challenge.', '2008-06-27 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788007, 691289, 74911, '<td valign="top">So cute...! It looks exactly the way you have titled it. Great work.</td>', 'So cute...! It looks exactly the way you have titled it. Great work.', '2008-06-27 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788011, 691550, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great image. Very well composed. Use of the simple background is the highlight here. I like the overall simplicity. Many times people forget the fact that more eliminate from your frame, stronger the image is.<br/> <br/>I did not like the way it is oversaturated, which is ok with the Red BG but does not look good on the metal part.</td>', 'Great image. Very well composed. Use of the simple background is the highlight here. I like the overall simplicity. Many times people forget the fact that more eliminate from your frame, stronger the image is. I did not like the way it is oversaturated, which is ok with the Red BG but does not look good on the metal part.', '2008-06-27 12:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788012, 691379, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Good title. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice subject. Good title. Nice composition.', '2008-06-27 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788013, 691480, 74911, '<td valign="top">This is technically a great picture, interms of the desaturation, sharpness, DOF, perspective, composition, point of view, choice of elements etc. But I am not able to associate with the title, may be it is my problem.</td>', 'This is technically a great picture, interms of the desaturation, sharpness, DOF, perspective, composition, point of view, choice of elements etc. But I am not able to associate with the title, may be it is my problem.', '2008-06-27 12:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788014, 691592, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, good lighting, intersting composition.</td>', 'Nice concept, good lighting, intersting composition.', '2008-06-27 12:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788015, 691559, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. By including a little bit of the top part of the building and some ground would have given a sense of completeness.</td>', 'Great perspective. By including a little bit of the top part of the building and some ground would have given a sense of completeness.', '2008-06-27 12:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788018, 691211, 74911, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing. Good sharpness and colors. But not very sure of the association between mother''s love and charity. I am not underrating this image because of my doubts.</td>', 'Excellent timing. Good sharpness and colors. But not very sure of the association between mother''s love and charity. I am not underrating this image because of my doubts.', '2008-06-27 12:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
