(4788022, 689981, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Good pose. IMHO, the lighting could have been a little softer to avoid the harsh shadows. Also, seems a little under-exposed and lacking contrast. Only these aspects make this image weaker.</td>', 'Nice composition. Good pose. IMHO, the lighting could have been a little softer to avoid the harsh shadows. Also, seems a little under-exposed and lacking contrast. Only these aspects make this image weaker.', '2008-06-27 13:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
