(4791632, 690216, 94931, '<td valign="top">I think he''s a little too much "in your face" to convey the term "innocence." My eyes also seem drawn to the nostril on the left.</td>', 'I think he''s a little too much "in your face" to convey the term "innocence." My eyes also seem drawn to the nostril on the left.', '2008-06-30 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
