(4791638, 691199, 94931, '<td valign="top">Too much emphasis on the t-shirt. Busy distracting background with all those people. Can you do selective color in basic editing?</td>', 'Too much emphasis on the t-shirt. Busy distracting background with all those people. Can you do selective color in basic editing?', '2008-06-30 12:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791647, 690313, 94931, '<td valign="top">Metallic elements are difficult to photograph, especially in a basic editing challenge where you have fewer tools at hand. The focus on the cross seems a bit off, and the text is slightly askew. You would have been better off to either take great care to align the text so that it was dead on with your lens or to rotate the camera to the side and increase the perspective. That way it doesn''t look like a mistake as here where it''s slightly off.</td>', 'Metallic elements are difficult to photograph, especially in a basic editing challenge where you have fewer tools at hand. The focus on the cross seems a bit off, and the text is slightly askew. You would have been better off to either take great care to align the text so that it was dead on with your lens or to rotate the camera to the side and increase the perspective. That way it doesn''t look like a mistake as here where it''s slightly off.', '2008-06-30 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791652, 690745, 94931, '<td valign="top">Where''s the heavenly virture?</td>', 'Where''s the heavenly virture?', '2008-06-30 12:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791655, 691566, 94931, '<td valign="top">Nice start, but it''s a bit flat. Needs more dark areas to it, especially the background, which is the same color cast as her face.</td>', 'Nice start, but it''s a bit flat. Needs more dark areas to it, especially the background, which is the same color cast as her face.', '2008-06-30 12:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791658, 690433, 94931, '<td valign="top">Too reliant on the title to convey a heavenly virtue.</td>', 'Too reliant on the title to convey a heavenly virtue.', '2008-06-30 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791669, 691644, 94931, '<td valign="top">Sure you didn''t mean this one for the 7 Deadly Sins?<br/> <br/>The hand in this photo is unsightly looking (I''m not saying you have an ugly hand, I just mean that at the proximity of the shot and the odd position of the hand), the purple shadow on it is odd looking, and the white is too dominate.</td>', 'Sure you didn''t mean this one for the 7 Deadly Sins? The hand in this photo is unsightly looking (I''m not saying you have an ugly hand, I just mean that at the proximity of the shot and the odd position of the hand), the purple shadow on it is odd looking, and the white is too dominate.', '2008-06-30 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791672, 691494, 94931, '<td valign="top">I would think this would make more sense if you had shot her in the moment of being baptised, where as in this image, it just looks like two people playing in the water.</td>', 'I would think this would make more sense if you had shot her in the moment of being baptised, where as in this image, it just looks like two people playing in the water.', '2008-06-30 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
