(4791704, 691524, 94931, '<td valign="top">That''s a wild shirt (colors and stripes) for a posed shot. (I''m assuming this was a posed shot, not something you captured in the moment.)</td>', 'That''s a wild shirt (colors and stripes) for a posed shot. (I''m assuming this was a posed shot, not something you captured in the moment.)', '2008-06-30 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791724, 689981, 94931, '<td valign="top">Watch for how shadows are cast, as here with the shadow from her arm across her shirt. Since this appears to be a posed shot, you should have ironed her shirt, and there even appears to be a stain on her shirt. <br/>Overall, this could be improved most by improving your lighting.</td>', 'Watch for how shadows are cast, as here with the shadow from her arm across her shirt. Since this appears to be a posed shot, you should have ironed her shirt, and there even appears to be a stain on her shirt. Overall, this could be improved most by improving your lighting.', '2008-06-30 13:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791727, 690544, 94931, '<td valign="top">The weighted composition is a good idea, I would have do it in a portrait frame instead of a landscape, with the empty space above her. I think that would work better with her looking up to God.</td>', 'The weighted composition is a good idea, I would have do it in a portrait frame instead of a landscape, with the empty space above her. I think that would work better with her looking up to God.', '2008-06-30 13:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
