(4792394, 691503, 36051, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m not getting the meaning of this capture but as a father I feel hurt.  If I am missing the humor and it''s meant tongue in cheek, then forgive me.  But the pose seems seems very serious (almost like she is deep in prayer) In a world where there is so much child abuse it hurts to think a child would need to pray to God for protection from her father.<br/>The capture itself is angelic.</td>', 'Maybe I''m not getting the meaning of this capture but as a father I feel hurt.  If I am missing the humor and it''s meant tongue in cheek, then forgive me.  But the pose seems seems very serious (almost like she is deep in prayer) In a world where there is so much child abuse it hurts to think a child would need to pray to God for protection from her father.The capture itself is angelic.', '2008-06-30 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
