(4797994, 691650, 67697, '<td valign="top">Guess I should leave my comment now. :)  I loved the big innocent eyes.  For me, that is what I wanted to see in focus more than anything.  At that age, the babies say so much with them:  they can smile and cry with those eyes.  What a gift!  I see sweet innocence and hope here.  A lovely moment.</td>', 'Guess I should leave my comment now. :)  I loved the big innocent eyes.  For me, that is what I wanted to see in focus more than anything.  At that age, the babies say so much with them:  they can smile and cry with those eyes.  What a gift!  I see sweet innocence and hope here.  A lovely moment.', '2008-07-02 11:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4798259, 689967, 90387, '<td valign="top">I disagree with an earlier comment.  I think the photo is MUCH more impactful BECAUSE not everyone is looking at the camera.  That would make it just another posed shot.  The way it is now makes it something special.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on an excellent image and a well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'I disagree with an earlier comment.  I think the photo is MUCH more impactful BECAUSE not everyone is looking at the camera.  That would make it just another posed shot.  The way it is now makes it something special. Congratulations on an excellent image and a well deserved ribbon!', '2008-07-02 12:28:21.000000', NULL, 0),
