(4798367, 691592, 9462, '<td valign="top">I''m confused on how some people don''t see a virtue in this photo.<br/>Charity is the most obvious. Hope, Faith, &amp; Fortitude are also easily represented. Justice might be a bit of a stretch but I see it.</td>', 'I''m confused on how some people don''t see a virtue in this photo.Charity is the most obvious. Hope, Faith, & Fortitude are also easily represented. Justice might be a bit of a stretch but I see it.', '2008-07-02 13:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4798797, 689967, 15810, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>Woo, nice surprise this morning<br/> <br/>I''ve been so lazy with my camera over the last year and really need to get back into the habit of shooting again<br/> <br/>Have to agree with Jaker (thanks very much for understanding)<br/> <br/>I have several shots with the nuns all facing front and alligned, I even had a shot of seven of them making which I thought was a sure fire "7 virtues" winner but on editing, this shot with the two "looks'' just stood out for me, I think it adds a personality to the shot that the other shots didn''t have.<br/> <br/>Very happy and thanks to all who voted and commented<br/> <br/></td>', ' Woo, nice surprise this morning I''ve been so lazy with my camera over the last year and really need to get back into the habit of shooting again Have to agree with Jaker (thanks very much for understanding) I have several shots with the nuns all facing front and alligned, I even had a shot of seven of them making which I thought was a sure fire "7 virtues" winner but on editing, this shot with the two "looks'' just stood out for me, I think it adds a personality to the shot that the other shots didn''t have. Very happy and thanks to all who voted and commented ', '2008-07-02 15:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
