(4821152, 691641, 20577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> i am always a little biased on these shots because i don''t believe Jesus died on a cross...but i digress, i think the lens flare really helps this shot /6 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Where did he die then? Maybe in a car wreck or something?</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: i am always a little biased on these shots because i don''t believe Jesus died on a cross...but i digress, i think the lens flare really helps this shot /6   Where did he die then? Maybe in a car wreck or something?', '2008-07-12 18:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
